				TITLE Elementary Arithmetic     (elementary-arithmetic.asm)

				; Author: Fauzi Kliman
				; Course / Project ID : Elementary Arithmetic                 Date: 9/24/17
				; Description: This program will introduce the programmer, get two numbers
